# Build switches read by `autophys build-web`. Copy to html/.env (gitignored)
# to change them for your own builds; the build's environment overrides it.
#
# TENTO_APP_SWITCHER: `on` bundles the Lona family app switcher
# (html/app-switcher.json: its links and icons) into the header. Off by
# default, so a clone of this repository builds without it. Lona's hosted
# builds (autophys.lona.so, dev--autophys.lona.so) set it to `on`.
# TENTO_APP_SWITCHER=on
